{"unit_id":"zz12hui__dsh-deai-audit#feature-1","repo":"zz12hui/dsh-deai-audit","commit":"fbceba10c95acd2a43611bd74a6b2aed17ac5d48","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-local-deai-audit 的「六维文案评分」：对输入文本计算结构、空泛词、句法、具体度、重复和人味六项分数，并按所选文体权重汇总。通过 DSH 的 deai_audit 工具提交 text，可选 genre。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:127-212","index.js:398-413"]}
